# Repository-root ignores.
#
# The tracked application lives entirely in Website/, which has its own
# .gitignore. This file guards the root itself, which doubles as a working
# directory for business documents that sit alongside the code and must never
# land in a public website repository.
#
# Every pattern here is root-anchored with a leading slash, so it applies only
# to files sitting directly at the repository root and can never shadow
# anything tracked under Website/.

# Business, financial, and client working documents.
/*.xlsx
/*.xlsm
/*.xls
/*.docx
/*.doc
/*.pptx
/*.csv
/*.pdf

# Environment files, in case one is ever dropped at the root by mistake.
/.env
/.env.*

# OS noise.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
